# SEO and accessibility

## Accessibility

- Skip link to `#main`. Visible focus ring (`outline: 2px solid var(--forest); outline-offset: 3px`). Never `outline: none` alone.
- Chapter triggers are `<button aria-expanded aria-controls>`. Escape closes. Hover is not the only way in.
- Thumb dock: `nav aria-label="Primary"` + `aria-current="page"`.
- Alt: describe the scene (“Avocado trees on Kagunga plantation, Njombe”). Empty alt only if decorative.
- Forms: `<label for>`, errors in text. Contrast stays AA in focus/hover too.

## SEO

Each page: unique title, meta description, canonical, Open Graph. `sitemap.xml` + `robots.txt`.

JSON-LD `Organization` is fine. `LocalBusiness` only with a confirmed address. Breadcrumb schema on inner pages.

Copy is factual and sparse. No keyword stuffing. Heading order: h1 → h2 → h3, no skips.

```html
<!-- ❌ -->
<img src="hero.jpg">
<a href="/contact" style="outline:none">Click here</a>

<!-- ✅ -->
<img src="hero.jpg" width="2400" height="1350" alt="Avocado canopy across Kagunga plantation in Njombe" />
<a href="/contact">Partner with us</a>
```
